  "notes": [
    "The post is tagged Dark and the list is a Dark My Lord, Is That Legal? deck (the draft had it as Light).",
    "The byline 'Jedi \"jedizeke\" Master' reads as a joke name (Jedi Master), not a real name, so the deck is credited to the DeckTech handle jedizeke with no player page.",
    "The title and strategy call this a 'Type II' deck for the Episode 1 environment (Episode I-only sets). The Coruscant-set Dark printings are used for Alter, Sense and Control.",
    "The Objective is posted under 'Objective (1)'; the 'Starting (7)' section lists Coruscant: Galactic Senate, Tatooine: Desert Landing Site, Tatooine: Podrace Arena, Start Your Engines!, Boonta Eve Podrace, Sebulba's Podracer and I Will Find Them Quickly, Master; all count toward the 60.",
    "Coruscant: Galactic Senate, Tatooine: Podrace Arena, Boonta Eve Podrace and Coruscant Guard dested the Dark versions; 'Start Your Engines' dested Start Your Engines!; 'This Is Outrageous' dested This Is Outrageous!; 'Yeb Yeb Adem&þ' (garbled character) dested Yeb Yeb Adem'thorn; 'Darth Maul' dested Darth Maul (Tatooine).",
    "The 'Political Effects (4)' header line was removed (the draft read it as a card)."
